WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.170
Vinnie watched the head roll across the floor.

2
00:00:04.171 --> 00:00:09.167
Luckily, it was only a wooden head from a wooden body.

3
00:00:09.168 --> 00:00:12.948
"Where are we?" he asked loudly.

4
00:00:12.949 --> 00:00:18.284
"Keep your voice down, Vinnie," said Helene.

5
00:00:18.285 --> 00:00:23.653
Helene peeked out to see if the guards were still following them.

6
00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:27.198
Vinnie and Mandy walked around the room.

7
00:00:27.199 --> 00:00:29.741
It was full of wigs.

8
00:00:29.742 --> 00:00:34.616
"Hey, look," said Mandy, as she tried one on.

9
00:00:34.617 --> 00:00:38.372
The white wig was huge, with lots of curls.

10
00:00:38.373 --> 00:00:41.484
"It’s very heavy!"

11
00:00:41.485 --> 00:00:46.810
"Look at me!" cried Vinnie, trying one on too.

12
00:00:46.811 --> 00:00:50.135
"Shush, Vinnie," said Helene.

13
00:00:50.136 --> 00:00:55.612
"Why does everyone wear wigs?" asked Mandy.

14
00:00:55.613 --> 00:00:57.189
"It’s the fashion.

15
00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:01.340
And King Louis sets the fashion," said Helene.

16
00:01:01.341 --> 00:01:04.449
"He changes his clothes many times a day.

17
00:01:04.450 --> 00:01:08.274
What he likes, everyone wears."

18
00:01:08.275 --> 00:01:13.820
"People change their clothes when the king does?" asked Mandy.

19
00:01:13.821 --> 00:01:16.548
"Of course," said Helene.

20
00:01:16.549 --> 00:01:19.954
"I think it’s safe to go now."

21
00:01:19.955 --> 00:01:23.653
The children silently followed her out.

22
00:01:23.654 --> 00:01:28.748
Walking through the palace, the children noticed many servants.

23
00:01:28.749 --> 00:01:33.959
"There are over nine thousand servants," whispered Helene.

24
00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.939
"They do many different jobs."

25
00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:42.622
The children slipped out of the palace through a back door.

26
00:01:42.623 --> 00:01:46.292
Then they went down the steps to the gardens.

27
00:01:46.293 --> 00:01:49.423
The horses from the hunt had returned.

28
00:01:49.424 --> 00:01:51.853
The dogs were back too.

29
00:01:51.854 --> 00:01:56.336
Important aides rushed over to the king.

30
00:01:56.337 --> 00:01:59.415
The children were pushed to the side.

31
00:01:59.416 --> 00:02:03.142
One gentleman removed the king’s jacket.

32
00:02:03.143 --> 00:02:05.278
Another took his gloves.

33
00:02:05.279 --> 00:02:08.294
King Louis did not look at anyone.

34
00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:11.147
He walked straight into the palace.

35
00:02:11.148 --> 00:02:15.489
His group followed close behind.

36
00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:20.346
"Children!" said a big man wearing a white apron.

37
00:02:20.347 --> 00:02:22.063
"Grab that game.

38
00:02:22.064 --> 00:02:23.434
Bring it to the kitchen!"

39
00:02:23.435 --> 00:02:26.711
He pointed to some dead rabbits.

40
00:02:26.712 --> 00:02:31.357
The animals were tied behind one of the horses.

41
00:02:31.358 --> 00:02:36.813
Helene instantly obeyed, but Mandy stood back.

42
00:02:36.814 --> 00:02:41.733
"Vinnie, I’m going to be sick," she said.

43
00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:45.400
"Just don’t look," Vinnie said.

44
00:02:45.401 --> 00:02:49.698
"I have to get away!" Mandy cried.

45
00:02:49.699 --> 00:02:52.742
She ran back into the palace.

46
00:02:52.743 --> 00:02:56.545
"Mandy!" Vinnie shouted after her.

47
00:02:56.546 --> 00:02:58.747
"Boy! Come in here!"

48
00:02:58.748 --> 00:03:04.157
The big man pulled Vinnie into the kitchen.

49
00:03:04.158 --> 00:03:07.554
Mandy didn’t know where she was going.

50
00:03:07.555 --> 00:03:10.140
She ran until she was out of breath.

51
00:03:10.141 --> 00:03:13.054
She found a door slightly open.

52
00:03:13.055 --> 00:03:14.604
She peeked in.

53
00:03:14.605 --> 00:03:19.188
Inside, a young lady stood before a large mirror.

54
00:03:19.189 --> 00:03:22.886
Mandy counted seven servants in the room.

55
00:03:22.887 --> 00:03:27.017
Each one held a different piece of clothing.

56
00:03:27.018 --> 00:03:31.068
"What is the king wearing?" the lady asked.

57
00:03:31.069 --> 00:03:35.074
"He is upset," said an older servant.

58
00:03:35.075 --> 00:03:37.656
"He caught only four rabbits.

59
00:03:37.657 --> 00:03:40.802
He will probably be wearing dark blue."

60
00:03:40.803 --> 00:03:44.941
"Then you know what dress to bring," the lady said.

61
00:03:44.942 --> 00:03:47.624
Mandy felt someone poke her.

62
00:03:47.625 --> 00:03:50.088
It was another servant.

63
00:03:50.089 --> 00:03:55.209
"What are you doing here?" the woman whispered sternly.

64
00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.739
Mandy quickly moved aside.

65
00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.881
The servant knocked and entered the room.

66
00:04:00.882 --> 00:04:03.533
Mandy overheard her saying:

67
00:04:03.534 --> 00:04:09.141
"My lady, the king will be changing to white and green."

68
00:04:09.142 --> 00:04:13.684
"Then bring my green gown," the young lady ordered.

69
00:04:13.685 --> 00:04:17.054
Mandy remembered what Helene said:

70
00:04:17.055 --> 00:04:23.579
everyone does what the king does.

